  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access Now 2023-2024 (2027) - Access Now Core support - Ny strategi 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Access Now 2023-2024 (2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By working with digital rights and support for vulnerable journalists and activists, Access Now aims to strengthen human rights in the digital space, and reach people living in poverty as well as human rights defenders, and other vulnerable people such as women, girls and LGBTIQ groups.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom att arbeta med digitala r&#xe4;ttigheter och support till utsatta journalister och aktivister vill Access Now st&#xe4;rka de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna i det digitala rummet, och n&#xe5; m&#xe4;nniskor som lever i fattigdom samt m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare, och andra utsatta som till exempel kvinnor, flickor och HBTIQ grupper.</narrative>
  </description>
